    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατροχ-άζω</span></b> , poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατρέχω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run
				past</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.372
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.163
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pass by</i> or <i>over, leave unnoticed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.169
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσεβίη οὔ με
