				<u>BC</u>
				3.70
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i>by</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Syr.</u>
				64
			</span></i>.</div>
